+    /**
+     * \brief Memory work while the CS thread is idle
+     *
+     * Arctic: the timed tasks otherwise run only after a submission, so
+     * a process that draws nothing would never see its budget fall below
+     * what it holds (a game came in front, see win32u's vulkan.c) and
